1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,223
Two beakers.

2
00:00:01,223 --> 00:00:05,078
Copper sulphate on the left, zinc sulphate on the right.

3
00:00:05,078 --> 00:00:11,158
Copper and zinc sit side by side in the periodic table, and both salts are sulphates.

4
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:15,260
Yet one solution is blue, and the other has no colour at all.

